  "description": "Unofficial modernized fork of Hawaii - a dotnet CLI tool that generates type-safe F# and Fable clients from OpenAPI/Swagger/OData. Targets .NET 10, reads OpenAPI 2.0/3.0/3.1/3.2, and generates System.Text.Json (F#) / Thoth.Json (Fable) clients. Not affiliated with the original project.",
  "id": "Hawaii.Unofficial",
