  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Unofficial modernized fork. .NET 10; Microsoft.OpenApi 3.x (reads OpenAPI 2.0/3.0/3.1/3.2, incl. the QUERY method); Fantomas 7; System.Text.Json for the F# target and Thoth.Json for the Fable target; discriminated unions generated from oneOf+discriminator schemas; OPTIONS/TRACE/QUERY HTTP methods; opt-in response headers and streaming responses; TimeSpan support; plus assorted codegen fixes.",
